		{
			dependencies: ["38166A02EA474C1E"]
			description: [
				"Dahua Anti-Circuit No. 30"
				"It's not much use"
				"&b&n&rsuper energetic silica solution is produced through &dproduction line by tearing &rsingle step silica &b&r"
				""
				"&4Attention &r"
				"Due to circulation problems, the end product of a single-stage silica fuel will be a certain amount of enriched silica waste liquid."
				"Due to the evil recursive loop, it is not removed from the recipe here and its recycling is not calculated."
				"Therefore, it is recommended that &bclick it when writing the &rtemplate"
				"If you ask me what to do with excess silica-enriched waste liquid in your network"
				"You can recycle it passively, but I recommend throwing it in the trash can or avoiding direct production of enriched silica fuel."
				"But when it comes to super reactors, we still have to use silica fuel."
				"So I suggest leaving it alone"
			]
			id: "50C409E34F4A20BC"
