		{
			dependencies: ["38166A02EA474C1E"]
			description: [
				"This tutorial also applies to circuit assembly lines"
				""
				"&6Advanced assembly line &rcan use &bsample assembly &r"
				"But &c&rassembly line cannot"
				"Although this private product has reduced the advanced assembly line"
				"But I think all GT players should know this"
				""
				"The following is what I summarized after exploring assembly line automation for a long time."
				"Automated tutorials applicable to most Gray integration packages"
				"For GTNH part applies"
				"1.12.2 Requires latest version of AE2 UEL"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"First, let's use an assembly line with a total length of 17 cells as an example:"
				"16-cell input bus + 4-cell input bay"
				"First, connect the input bus &6&rand the input enclosure &b&rto the storage bus &e&r"
				"Connect them with the ME cable"
				"Put a &dME &rinterface"
				"Then supply power to this subnet"
				"The mainnet sample provider &6&rmust be close to the ME interface"
				"Note that there must be directivity &a&ror &ain &rpanel shape"
				""
				"In this way, you have configured a subnet distribution &breceiving end &r"
				"This is also the construction method commonly used by most players."
				"But when you put the model in the model provider"
				"Frequent Problems &cIt is easy to get stuck during continuous distribution &r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"See how to solve the problem"
				"You must have heard about nh's &d&radvanced blocking card"
				"In fact, the top version AE2 &acomes with &radvanced lock"
				"It just doesn't work as expected in practical applications"
				""
				"The reason is simple:"
				"&cGT input bin and input bus, AE cannot take items from them &r"
				""
				"Although players can take it out manually"
				"But for the storage bus:"
				"Whether &dcan be picked up determines whether the mainnet can see items in this subnet &r"
				""
				"To mean:"
				"To your default mainnet provider"
				"No matter how many times it is distributed"
				"This subnet &cappears as empty &r"
				"Therefore, the supplier will ship &call the time and &rall the time."
				"Furthermore, the ME interface has cache"
				"&cis stuck &r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&aSolution: &r"
				"Open on any memory bus &b&r"
				"&6【The display cannot be removed】 &r"
				"So &aincreases the priority of this memory bus &r"
				"Let items entering the subnet enter this input bus first"
				""
				"This way, the main network can normally see the subnet items"
				"&bAdvanced lock &ralso works normally"
				"Although this problem can also be solved with synthetic locking..."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:assembly_line"
