		{
			dependencies: ["38166A02EA474C1E"]
			description: [
				"&l&a1. Basic explanation &r"
				"Able to write templates efficiently, to be more precise, &bgenerates templates"
				"&rSimply put, it filters all recipes based on the keywords you enter."
				"Recipes that meet the filter conditions will automatically generate templates"
				"It is &bthat loops through the recipes to generate the model &r, not a wildcard model."
				""
				"&l&b2. Preparation &r"
				"1. Press F3+H to open the game's advanced prompt box (must be enabled)"
				"2. Hold the model tool, &lright-click the air &rto open the user interface (the interface is slightly misaligned, which does not affect the use)"
				"You can also use &b/kjs hand &rto get item information"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l&e3. Teaches you step by step how to make a \\\"spindle rod\\\" sample (example) &r"
				"1. Open the JEI item manager and search for any stamp recipe (for example: iron ingots to make iron bars)"
				"2. Remember four important pieces of information:"
				"Recipe ID: extruder (extruder)"
				"Programming circuit: 0 (if there is no circuit, fill in 0)"
				"Input item: ingot (ingot)"
				"Output item: rod (rod)"
				"3. Fill in the format in the tool:"
				"extruder 0 0 (fill the required multiple) unfilled ingot unfilled rod"
				"&bmeans &r: &ato search for formulas without circuits for stamp, all formulas whose input item ID contains ingot and output item ID contains rod."
				"&r4. &cClick √ to save (very important!!!) &r→ Click &lto get sample &r"
				"5. The tool automatically generates templates. When there is not enough space in the backpack, the models will fall to the ground."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l&c4. 4 Important Things to Note &r"
				"1. Do not generate samples containing circuit items (integrated circuits, processors, etc.). The tool cannot generate general circuit boards."
				"2. The generated template &l&cdoes not have &r&rprogramming circuit by default."
				"3. If you can't make silica stargate mod, please fill sgjourney into the entry blacklist to block it."
				"4. Regular generation will mix long pole model, please fill in correctly:"
				"0 multi ingot extruder does not fill long rod and fills long &rto filter long rod in output blacklist &l"
				""
				"&l&d5. Working principle (simple explanation) &r"
				"The tool relies on item ID matching recipes to generate automated models:"
				"Fill in recipe type → tool finds corresponding machine"
				"Fill in the programming circuit → match the number of the circuit that is not consumed (fill in 0 if there is no circuit)"
				"Black and white list rules:"
				"✅ Whitelist = must contain specified text"
				"❌ Blacklist = cannot contain specified text"
				"Multiple keywords can be separated by &lspace &r"
			]
			icon: "gtlcore:debug_pattern_test"
